    <chapter title="Why it is not here" id="why">
        <p>
            Every page of this site is written from the source of Aether Weaver and reviewed
            against it before it appears. The sections therefore arrive one at a time, rather
            than all at once as an outline. An outline in a repository reads like
            documentation, and the reader cannot tell the difference until it is too late.
        </p>
        <p>
            The source is on <a href="%repo%">GitHub</a>. A question this site does not answer
            yet belongs in the <a href="%issues%">issue tracker</a>.
        </p>
